# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: receipt contract, actuation binding, and replay morphism present.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:ReceiptDAG a dfcm:ReceiptContract .
dfcm:ActuationToReceipt dfcm:requires dfcm:ReceiptDAG .
dfcm:ReceiptToReplay a dfcm:Morphism .
